  "historyNote": "#3104, eff 8-22-85; amd by #3128, eff 10-1-85; ss by #4116, eff 8-21-86; ss by #4296, eff 7-21-87; ss by #4462, eff 7-29-88; ss by #4663, eff 8-21-89; ss by #4828, eff 6-1-90; amd by #4859, eff 1-1-91; ss by #5198, eff 8-2-91; amd by #5411, eff 6-19-92; amd by #5458, eff 8-28-92; amd by #5660, eff 6-28-93; ss by #5828, eff 5-24-94; amd by #6041, eff 5-18-95; amd by #6193, eff 2-22-96; ss by #6250, eff 5-22-96; ss by #6520, eff 5-31-97; ss by #6783, eff 6-30-98; amd by #7107, eff 9-25-99; ss by #7289, eff 6-1-00; amd by #7427, eff 1-17-01; ss by #7699, eff 6-5-02; ss by #8085, eff 5-26-04; amd by #8249, eff 1-6-05; ss by #8644, eff 6-1-06; amd by #8931, eff 7-6-07; ss by #9163, eff 5-28-08; amd by #9458, eff 4-21-09; amd by #9720-A, eff 6-5-10, paras (a)-(n) & (p)-(t)); amd by #9720-B, eff 6-5-10, (para (o)); amd by #9948-A, eff 6-24-11, (paras (a)-(n) & (p)-(v); amd by #9948-B, eff 6-24-11, (para (o)); ss by #10142, eff 6-5-12; ss by #10619, eff 6-2-14; ss by #10751, eff 1-1-15; ss by #10891, INTERIM, eff 7-17-15, EXPIRED: 1-13-16 New. #11114, eff 6-3-16; amd by #12591, eff 7-25-18; ss by #13211, eff 5-26-21; ss by #13655, eff 6-1-23; ss by #14308, eff 7-10-25; ss by #14494, eff 1-24-26, EXPIRES: 1-24-36",
